explode. Watch out for other traps too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There\u2019s more than one way to play:</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to the goal! Bounce, stick, and aim your way through grid-based puzzles using smart angles and color swaps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/da9b131880bebe10c57aa1706ed25979.poster.avif?t=1757773264\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/da9b131880bebe10c57aa1706ed25979.webm?t=1757773264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/da9b131880bebe10c57aa1706ed25979.mp4?t=1757773264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Infinite Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive as long as you can. Things only get faster, meaner, and more chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/39b9bb60050a2682ab5b55b9c48e08bb.poster.avif?t=1757773264\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/39b9bb60050a2682ab5b55b9c48e08bb.webm?t=1757773264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685030/extras/39b9bb60050a2682ab5b55b9c48e08bb.mp4?t=1757773264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're in for a quick session or a challenge, Neon Strike keeps it simple, vibrant, and fun to retry.</p>","developers":["Reza Mirzaei"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","